Subject: [PATCH 7/8] feat(harness): Coding Harness distribution

harness/harness projects the core into .harness-aidlc and emits the host
shell: persona task agents (host/agents), the /aidlc prompt, the method
include list, the adapter extension and the orchestrator skill derived
from the Claude skill. The bootstrap .harness/extensions/aidlc.ts is a
whole-file root integration that re-exports the adapter.
